A massive<ref name="World Building">{{InsiderCite|227|World Building (Star Wars Insider 227)}}</ref> '''datavault''' maintained for the [[Imperial Security Bureau]] was located within in the [[ISB Central Office|ISB central office]] on [[Coruscant]]. It contained [[Data-tape|datatapes]] with data from multiple Imperial sectors under ISB supervision, which officers could use in their investigations. While normally restricted to data from the sectors under their jurisdiction, in special circumstances supervisors could also request [[Multi-Sector Data Blends]] which would give them access to patterns of data matching their given description across all Imperial sectors. In [[5 BBY]], it was manned by [[ISB Attendant|Attendant]] [[Felzonis]] with the assistance of two imperial [[protocol droid]]s. Supervisor [[Dedra Meero]] visited him to request a Data Blend to complete her investigation into a stolen [[Imperial N-S9 Starpath Unit|NS-9 Starpath unit]].<ref name="Announcement" />

